OL,3,GNEWSAThe volunteers baking birthday
OL,4,Acakes for children
OL,5,
OL,6,FVolunteer bakers are paying out of
OL,7,Ftheir own pockets so children in need
OL,8,Fdo not go without a cake on their
OL,9,Fbirthdays.
OL,11,FFree Cakes for Kids Fareham and Gosport
OL,12,Fbuys the ingredients, bakes and
OL,13,Fdelivers cakes for young people whose
OL,14,Ffamilies are unable to provide one.
OL,16,FNatalie Parker, who joined as a baker
OL,17,Fwhile on maternity leave in 2024 and
OL,18,Fnow runs the group, said the thought of
OL,19,Fa child not having a birthday cake was
OL,20,F"heart-breaking".
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
